# Build outputs.
_novo/

# The built package binary — a library package still produces one when
# a probe or a test is built against it.
gguf-nv

# Generated from the sources by `novo doc`; a committed copy is a
# second original.
APIDOC.md

# Resolved deps.  Regenerated from novo.toml on every build, and a
# committed copy pins what the manifest already ranges over.
novo.lock
